# Scheduling

Store local times and an IANA timezone on the campaign. Persist the execution instant in UTC.

Skip a local time that does not exist on a spring-forward day. On a fall-back overlap, use `fold=0` (the earlier offset).

After downtime, publish at most one missed slot, and only inside `missed_slot_grace_seconds`. Record older missed slots and do not burst-publish them. Pause, resume, and schedule edits move `schedule_cursor` to now and cancel unsent schedule posts.

An unapproved post stays pending after its slot. Approving it later publishes immediately. A campaign with an unfinished schedule post does not receive another slot.

The worker is a separate process of this package. In-memory or FastAPI background tasks are not the scheduler.
